se,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"Feature request for product/service\n– Other – \nDescribe the request\nI really love grokbot as a concept, however it’s very difficult to overcome the glaring security vulnerability with prompt injection, considering indivi\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"thumbnails":null,"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":310,"name":"security","slug":"security"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":0,"views":142,"category_id":5,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":0,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":"latest single","description":"Original Poster, Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":135204,"username":"moves","name":"","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/moves/{size}/119217_2.png","trust_level":0}}]},{"fancy_title":"Shared Grok Bot team across teammates (same roster, separate chats)","id":169904,"title":"Shared Grok Bot team across teammates (same roster, separate chats)","slug":"shared-grok-bot-team-across-teammates-same-roster-separate-chats","posts_count":12,"reply_count":1,"highest_post_number":19,"image_url":null,"created_at":"2026-08-29T10:44:31.186Z","last_posted_at":"2026-09-30T23:47:43.983Z","bumped":true,"bumped_at":"2026-09-30T23:47:43.983Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"Feature request for product/service\nCloud Agent (GitHub, Slack, Linear,…) \nDescribe the request\nTwo co-founders, one business, one Grok Bot staff. \nWe both need to message the same bots — Sales, Ops, Chief of Staff — in \u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"thumbnails":null,"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":309,"name":"teams-enterprise","slug":"teams-enterprise"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":32,"views":701,"category_id":5,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":10,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":n